<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Retailing stocks cited.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Retailing stocks cited.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it named retailing as its featured industry of the week.</p>
<p>-- cited Nordstrom Inc and Tiffany &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>-- Nordstrom shares fell 1/4 to 41-1/8, while Tiffany dropped 1/2 to 35-3/4.</p>
</text>
